With these two small changes in ComboBox.js (conditional aria-controls, passing your ariaLabel into the Field) plus the tweak in ListBoxField.js (respecting a consumer’s aria-label), you’ll eliminate the “invalid ID” errors and give your combobox container a proper accessible name.
